# The second half's damage spells and the breaths (mobs' spells, which only an immortal can cast), cast by Smokegod
# (60, neutral, every skill at 100, mana to spare), with only area_update running, so each victim strikes back once.
# At the entrance to Mud School (3700), with Decimus (10, good, armed and armoured). Each cast is waited out.
# - harm (three times), lightning bolt, magic missile, shocking grasp, general purpose and high explosive on a
#   septon (9006)
# - heat metal on Decimus (his gear gets dropped or sears him) and on a cityguard with a sword
# - holy word, neutral: the neutral fido is frenzied and blessed, the others are cursed and struck down
# - ray of truth on a goblin (evil), a drunk (good: unharmed), and by an evil Smokegod (it explodes inside)
# - acid, fire, frost, lightning and gas breath, each on a fresh drunk, with potions, scrolls, a drink and food on
#   the floor and in what the first carries, for the room's and the carried effects
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer decimus 3700
@mob 9006 3700
cast harm septon
@pulse 24
cast harm septon
@pulse 24
cast harm septon
@pulse 24
cast 'lightning bolt' septon
@pulse 24
cast 'magic missile' septon
@pulse 24
cast 'shocking grasp' septon
@pulse 24
cast 'general purpose' septon
@pulse 24
cast 'high explosive' septon
@pulse 24
peace
slay septon
cast 'heat metal' decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'heat metal' decimus
@pulse 24
peace
@mob 3060 3700
load obj 3021
give sword cityguard
force cityguard wield sword
cast 'heat metal' cityguard
@pulse 24
peace
slay cityguard
@mob 3062 3700
@mob 3501 3700
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'holy word'
@pulse 24
@state
peace
restore smokegod
@mob 3501 3700
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'ray of truth' goblin
@pulse 24
cast 'ray of truth' drunk
@pulse 24
peace
set char smokegod align -1000
cast 'ray of truth' drunk
@pulse 24
peace
set char smokegod align 0
restore smokegod
@obj 105 3700
@obj 1362 3700
@obj 611 3700 20 10 0 0 0
@mob 3064 3700
force drunk get all
@obj 105 3700
@obj 1362 3700
cast 'acid breath' drunk
@pulse 24
peace
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'fire breath' drunk
@pulse 24
peace
@mob 3064 3700
@obj 105 3700
@obj 611 3700 20 10 0 0 0
cast 'frost breath' drunk
@pulse 24
peace
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'lightning breath' drunk
@pulse 24
peace
@mob 3064 3700
@obj 20 3700
cast 'gas breath'
@pulse 24
peace
@state
